B.Y8=s(["D\xf6rtyol ve Korkuteli mevkilerindeki h\u0131z s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131na dikkat edin.","Gazima\u011fusa giri\u015finde Alt\u0131nba\u015f ve K-Pet istasyonlar\u0131 yak\u0131t ikmali i\xe7in a\xe7\u0131kt\u0131r."],t.s)
B.a0a=s(["Observe speed limits at Dortyol and Korkuteli junctions.","Altinbas and K-Pet gas stations are available upon entering Famagusta."],t.s)
